  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个站，每个月四千多万访问量。 域名就等于钱。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>bmi calculator 这个关键字，跟减肥相关，会很值钱</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>但是竞争难度很大，所以可以看看这个词的长尾词，看能不能找到竞争难度没那么大的\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这些都是离钱近的词\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>Claude 生成的</div>\n<div>仔细看一下这个页面的布局，也是之前我总结过的优化方式：分门别类罗列\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个站从youtube获取了很多流量\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/tmoodwhlhf_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
